{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-08-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「2026季前嘉年華」騎師競跑及馬匹草地試閘於今天在沙田馬場舉行。重頭戲是騎師競跑接力賽，今年這項錦標一如以往以接力形式競逐，每隊由兩位騎師組成，在100米的途程上進行接力賽。</p>\n<p>一眾參賽騎師奮勇向前，結果由梁家俊和希威森的組合先聲奪人，勝出新馬季開鑼前的首場非正式賽事，並從馬會CEO應家柏手上接過冠軍獎盃、獎牌及五千港元獎金的支票。</p>\n<p>田泰安及班德禮的組合則跑入亞席，獲頒亞軍獎牌及三千港元獎金的支票；另外，而巫顯東及呂聖澤的組合則奪得季軍，獲頒季軍獎牌及二千港元獎金的支票。</p>\n<p>梁家俊和都希望希望九月六日開鑼賽贏馬響頭炮，一如騎師競跑般率先彈出，旗開得勝。</p>\n<p>今午馬主嘉年華，場面熱鬧，不少馬主、騎練及與小朋友無懼炎熱的天氣，一家大小一齊到場，場內提供有各項遊戲活，供小朋友玩耍。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e414d1a322d7694b0f16fa814711e735/2026-08/0ba92f2e-6bf1-4cc3-92f5-46c04f556249.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8cd78ace5604cc17ec7416cd95859443/2026-08/6df962b9-b987-49f7-ab0a-fa2277a51ae0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fad9179a04ed8591c2621a27272b2493/2026-08/7ed8d42d-c8c7-477f-b0b3-be7b40f8d1bd.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84bab3fc197e66157cad988d20af081c/2026-08/63bddfa9-d477-4299-8668-b6f925eaf2d2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/11916c49e6b42dc84c27a55a805c0893/2026-08/68c20dc5-3617-4c83-8f0c-86853784669f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/586a689bdad72e4334250d0a357b4611/2026-08/75ef8860-de04-41ec-bab0-475052a59a47.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b90f890e0bdc1a675c371737e82c844c/2026-08/84e8f602-715d-4142-be93-8a6bb2838186.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ad218c9facfab7f150b8002aa570aa25/2026-08/87c585eb-b2c6-4e29-9e83-9ca16f27ad60.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4130424ebe9afeddd00dee8deb10be80/2026-08/476b627c-3de0-4aac-8f2c-b01f1631499a.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8803038665e97b20c0e12bab1038d8bf/2026-08/7958f206-1c3e-4470-9920-7e5aa4910e40.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0e319fbec38298153a096fb1f3366c2b/2026-08/8669cac1-cccc-42f8-8b79-7b56e5c70a35.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/36fed975f9d02ea3c9afc645e376028c/2026-08/805427dc-f2a8-425b-ac2c-88ab3735b605.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c256bcbf1b9adeb98f64981ce9a2e51/2026-08/ca5be47a-2513-4cd0-b3b5-8e3c2b52ccce.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2340275d332df2334f8b9baea3aefd15/2026-08/d368bf75-9bd5-45a5-b514-d80e3562efa4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/565d6a1cd26ca2e08a2d03d5d9a39d0a/2026-08/e146e096-7b70-41b1-9ca0-cc5d3574c4df.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44e18db882d9232627883a4da1054f86/2026-08/edebe4e5-60ac-4968-a242-dca85e301277.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7644e9e1a96e3b29d930dac6b1f5cbb2/2026-08/f3a8a069-236f-49a8-b5db-a7c5830e2ed5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2fb616247a76b1e7213cb7183ef56dfc/2026-08/f8fceca3-5143-4efe-94f2-162abdb07072.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4e533d9b1e622564184277b34cac6efe/2026-08/fe441cbf-ffda-4579-96ab-fc6a4da38251.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳嘉甜</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T10:18:22.013851+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":379,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}